# Route: guide 11 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Skyborne
# (1291 of 1301 eligible quests, 161.8 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 30 to
# 34, 36 quests, 7.0 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Mulgore, The Barrens, Stranglethorn Vale): Windfury Ridge -> Thunder
# Bluff -> Skywatcher Plateau -> Bael Modan -> Razorfen Downs -> Razorfen
# Kraul -> Camp Taurajo -> Ratchet -> Honor's Stand -> Ratchet -> Grom'gol
# Base Camp -> Kal'ai Ruins -> Bal'lal Ruins -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): A Host of Evil (6626; Razorfen
# Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist 33-34).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2760 The
# Mithril Order; 2761 Smelt On, Smelt Off; 2762 The Great Silver Deceiver;
# 2763 The Art of the Imbue; 2764 Galvan's Finest Pupil; 2765 Expert
# Blacksmith!; 3642 The Pledge of Secrecy; 3643 Show Your Work; 3645
# Membership Card Renewal; 5148 Tribal Leatherworking.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Leaders of the Fang (914), A Vengeful Fate (1102),
# Searching for the Lost Satchel (5722), Testing an Enemy's Strength (5723),
# Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication (1487), The Glowing Shard
# (6981).

